<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"_h2z _297z _usd img\" id=\"u_4g_2\" src=\"https://scontent.fkhh1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/94712850_2980181962074235_790362677833629696_o.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;_nc_sid=32a93c&amp;_nc_ohc=_1ftvTXnEfsAX8Xsfwe&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fkhh1-1.fna&amp;oh=f97d73de369ce635c746cfa6a0f0be2f&amp;oe=5ECFC5B0\" style=\"border: 0px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-height: 700px; max-width: 700px;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #1c1e21; font-family: &quot;georgia&quot; , serif; font-size: small; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2004年3--月，李江却台語文教基金會舉辦「台文通訊海內外讀者kap編者聯誼會」， 黃晴美（第一排tsiànn手爿算--來第一位）特別tuì瑞典tńg來參加。</span></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br />\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87bong%E5%A0%B1?source=note&amp;epa=HASHTAG\" style=\"color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; text-decoration-line: none;\"><span class=\"_4yxo\" style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;\">#台文BONG報</span></a><br />\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87bong%E5%A0%B1?source=note&amp;epa=HASHTAG\" style=\"color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; text-decoration-line: none;\"><span class=\"_4yxo\" style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;\"><br /></span></a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%AB%E7%9C%9F?source=note&amp;epa=HASHTAG\" style=\"color: #385898; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; text-decoration-line: none;\"><span class=\"_4yxo\" style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: 600;\">#台灣人寫真</span></a></div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E4%BA%BA%E5%AF%AB%E7%9C%9F?source=note&amp;epa=HASHTAG\" style=\"color: